 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-MiyeV8h6QQ7kNvwGXCIK2&_nc_oc=AdrVgVuP9EOggsFG9lquJsggOnZWyX_nFcsBJLLjyRwittN9-sQHX9vGrHon1KqdtjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO36EDsiToRt2I1MocsTEiyl5vUjmw8EeYHobOS0ufJgw&oe=6ACCFA41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5lr_7gBTt4Q7kNvwG9HIrF&_nc_oc=AdoZOcRd1zPZzFOQ5wpuCAkkF6r8FNyee2Bk25MYLKHdKmIJFfgrmEr4T07T6ukClTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPyMWmankLU1Uf976SFmquGoJl1KmUZb-5fN0fLgBE46g&oe=6ACD07A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7C11UO_pL0Q7kNvwHOJN63&_nc_oc=AdrlqQGBuDqj3vAoeYKlhYkvjMonaQtOQvrya6sYOOW_qpnR45XwQi9l0FfH2jN_Gws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPcXd-IAinhxTsY0IQWUMeYwZMrUnE82DB2pK-CJCp4oA&oe=6ACD119C"}, {"fil